ting skebs, I contacted you to ask if you could illustrate Hojo Wreckage and his own searcher HO1.\n\n（I would love to hear from you if you would be interested in drawing an illustration of Houjou Kure and HO1.)\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/s/l9qo6vptfgsckwb/%E7%84%A1%E9%A1%8C53_20221110023449.png?dl=0\n(Standing picture in achromatic color)\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/s/hk151e51ey7vm3n/%E7%84%A1%E9%A1%8C117_20221110023628.png?dl=0\n\nThe standing picture is available here.\nHO1 has an energetic and doggy-like personality, and has had exchanges with Wreckage-san, who sometimes treated her like a dog.\n\nI would be happy if you could draw an illustration of the self-seeker smiling happily after being patted on the head by the wreckage.\nThank you very much.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}